# The five entries here before this rewrite all pointed into `src-tauri/` —
# ai.rs, memory.rs, rdp_agent.rs, incident.rs and lib.rs — which left the tree
# with v1 in September 2026. GitHub does not warn about a CODEOWNERS path that
# matches nothing; it just quietly requests no review. The paths below are the
# ones those rules were reaching for, in the crate they live in now.

